## 🎨 DESIGN PATTERNS TO ADOPT

### Color Scheme
- **Primary:** Purple/Blue gradient (from research page)
- **Badges:** Purple-100 bg, purple-800 text
- **Cards:** White bg, colored borders on hover
- **Metrics:** Color-coded by capability type

### Layout Patterns
- **Badge headers:** Inline-flex, rounded-full, icon + text
- **Card grids:** 3-column on desktop, 2 on tablet, 1 on mobile
- **Expandable sections:** AnimatePresence with height animation
- **Progress bars:** Animated width transitions

### Interaction Patterns
- **Click to expand:** Cards expand to show detailed demos
- **Loading states:** Spinner during "testing"
- **Results reveal:** Progressive animation of results
- **Confidence scores:** Color-coded (green ≥80%, yellow ≥70%, red <70%)

