## 🔧 IMPLEMENTATION PLAN

### Phase 1: Extract & Genericize Components (2-3 hours)
1. Extract `ResearchAccelerationMetrics` → `GenericMetricsShowcase`
2. Extract `HypothesisTestingSection` → `GenericCapabilityShowcase`
3. Extract `ResearchInteractiveShowcase` → `GenericInteractiveShowcase`
4. Extract `ResearchHeroSection` → `GenericHeroSection`
