### Phase 2: Create Healthcare-Specific Wrappers (1-2 hours)
1. Create `HealthcareMOATMetrics.tsx` (wraps GenericMetricsShowcase)
2. Create `MOATInteractiveShowcase.tsx` (wraps GenericInteractiveShowcase)
3. Create `MOATCapabilityShowcase.tsx` (wraps GenericCapabilityShowcase)
4. Create `HealthcareHeroSection.tsx` (wraps GenericHeroSection)

### Phase 3: Integrate into Healthcare Page (1-2 hours)
1. Replace hero with `HealthcareHeroSection`
2. Add `HealthcareMOATMetrics` after hero
3. Replace `BusinessTransformation` with `MOATInteractiveShowcase`
4. Add `MOATCapabilityShowcase` for interactive testing
5. Update content data to match new structure

### Phase 4: Polish & Test (1 hour)
1. Test all interactions
2. Verify responsive design
3. Check animations
4. Validate content accuracy

